{"id":"silicon-neuroma-adept","name":"Silicon Neuroma (Adept)","type":"Sniper Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0c5f8ba587b0b3d9de740dda53890049.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/1387987271.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Firmly Planted","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/379796d2e74676d3790f0bd485ea03a9.png","desc":"Increased accuracy, stability, and handling when firing while crouched."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Firing Line","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/92a5e8dbef32a414709d3196cb815d89.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased precision damage when near two or more allies."},{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Stunning Recovery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0deaae9c67009f285a400ab5dd407138.png","desc":"Stunning a Champion refills your magazine, triggers health regeneration, and improves recovery for a short duration."},{"name":"Vanguard's Vindication","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c7feebe5d55e4611c5d031d50eaca7ed.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant a small amount of health."}]}],"notes":["Inspired by DMB Podcast 262 conversation with @ItzShadow. PvP first-choice S-Tier roll for duelling. The lowest zoom scope on an aggressive frame sniper, but the origin trait's not really any use in PvP, unfortunately. Look for range with barrel and mag, without damaging other stats. Snapshot Sights is still useful to be first to ADS and is essential with the low handling, while Opening Shot maximises range and boosts aim assist when active. Recommended MW: Handling or Stability (to help a little with flinch), with a Targeting Adjuster mod if you're more passive or Quick Access Sling mod if you're more aggressive.","pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Aggressive snipers have been lacking ever since Bite of the Fox was removed from the loot pool. With the exact same zoom levels and a circular scope it is a nice alternative to those who don’t have one (or non-sunset version) with the ability to slot adept mods come the grandmaster release. For PvE, firing line will be your best friend. Triple tap with appended mag and adept backup mag or regular backup mag with extended mag you will hit the perfect threshold for triple tap returns.\". Recommended MW - Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB / Controller): \"Silicon Neuroma is the current Bite of the Fox alternative. Even with the snapshot / opening shot combo. The biggest factor is the addition of adept mods like adept handling or adept icarus to really bump up the feel.\". Recommended MW - Handling.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first choice roll for Burst damage on a Major or Boss. The Stunning Recovery origin trait could be useful when there's an anti-champion sniper mod. Choose your barrel depending on your Range/Stability/Handling preferences. Appended Mag with Adept Backup Mag gets you to five rounds in the mag, giving seven crit hits before reloading with Triple Tap. Firing Line is your choice for damage in a fireteam, while Frenzy or Focused Fury are better for solo activities. Recommended MW: Reload Speed or Handling, with Adept Backup Mag mod.","[YeezyGT's WQ] [MW: Handling / Range] \"Silicon Neuroma's back, and coming for Succession's neck. Snapshot/Opening Shot is the usual god-roll, though there's some interesting interactions with Frenzy / Adrenaline Junkie (in a separate col. to Snapshot) that allows for 1-shot body shots (setup-dependent). Firmly Planted also has a strong following, so its safe to say we'll see some of these floating around when the Adepts become available.\" tags:god-pvp","Chevy's S16 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Handling/Reload"],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,24,32],[6,15,26,34],[6,16,26,34],[0,11,23,29],[0,11,23,30],[0,11,23,32],[0,11,24,29],[0,11,24,30],[0,11,24,32],[0,13,23,29],[0,13,23,30],[0,13,23,32],[0,13,24,29],[0,13,24,30],[0,13,24,32],[0,14,26,29,35],[0,14,26,29,36],[0,14,26,31,35],[0,14,26,31,36],[0,14,26,33,35],[0,14,26,33,36],[0,14,26,34,35],[0,14,26,34,36],[0,14,28,29,35],[0,14,28,29,36],[0,14,28,31,35],[0,14,28,31,36],[0,14,28,33,35],[0,14,28,33,36],[0,14,28,34,35],[0,14,28,34,36],[0,15,23,29],[0,15,23,33],[0,15,23,34],[0,15,26,29],[0,15,26,29,35],[0,15,26,29,36],[0,15,26,31,35],[0,15,26,31,36],[0,15,26,33],[0,15,26,33,35],[0,15,26,33,36],[0,15,26,34],[0,15,26,34,35],[0,15,26,34,36],[0,15,28,29],[0,15,28,29,35],[0,15,28,29,36],[0,15,28,31,35],[0,15,28,31,36],[0,15,28,33],[0,15,28,33,35],[0,15,28,33,36],[0,15,28,34],[0,15,28,34,35],[0,15,28,34,36],[0,16,23,29],[0,16,23,33],[0,16,23,34],[0,16,26,29],[0,16,26,29,35],[0,16,26,29,36],[0,16,26,31,35],[0,16,26,31,36],[0,16,26,33],[0,16,26,33,35],[0,16,26,33,36],[0,16,26,34],[0,16,26,34,35],[0,16,26,34,36],[0,16,28,29],[0,16,28,29,35],[0,16,28,29,36],[0,16,28,31,35],[0,16,28,31,36],[0,16,28,33],[0,16,28,33,35],[0,16,28,33,36],[0,16,28,34],[0,16,28,34,35],[0,16,28,34,36],[0,19,26,29,35],[0,19,26,29,36],[0,19,26,31,35],[0,19,26,31,36],[0,19,26,33,35],[0,19,26,33,36],[0,19,26,34,35],[0,19,26,34,3